<div class="mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output" lang="en" dir="ltr"><p>We are happy to have you join our Fandom community and are looking into getting started!
</p>
<figure class="thumb mw-halign-right show-info-icon" typeof="mw:File/Thumb" style="width: 200px"> 	<a href="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/central/images/5/5c/Advice-beginner-your_first_steps.png/revision/latest?cb=20231002201214" class="mw-file-description image" style="display: inline-block; position: relative;"><img alt="Let's get started with your fan journey!" src="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/central/images/5/5c/Advice-beginner-your_first_steps.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20231002201214" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="200" height="200" class="thumbimage lazyloaded" data-image-name="Advice-beginner-your first steps.png" data-image-key="Advice-beginner-your_first_steps.png" data-relevant="0" data-src="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/central/images/5/5c/Advice-beginner-your_first_steps.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20231002201214"><div style="position: absolute; bottom: 0px; right: 0px; width: 100%; height: 100%;"><!-- -1 children --></div></a> 	 	<figcaption class="thumbcaption"> 		 			 		 		 		 			<p class="caption">Let's get started with your fan journey!</p> 		 	</figcaption> </figure>
<p>In this very simple tutorial, you will learn the essentials of how to<b> sign up and set up your account on Fandom</b>, how to get started with <b>contributing to wikis</b> - both the web pages containing fan documentation, and how to get started with <b>joining the discussion around your favorite franchises</b>. After reading up on these simple basics, you will be able to explore and join your favorite fandom wikis to connect with other people sharing the same passion!
</p>
<h2><span id="How_do_I_sign_up_for_a_Fandom_user_account.3F"></span><span class="mw-headline" id="How_do_I_sign_up_for_a_Fandom_user_account?">How do I sign up for a Fandom user account?</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a title="Sign in to edit" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor" data-tracking-label="log-in-edit-section" data-action="edit-section" href="https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fcommunity.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUser_blog%3AMarphimon%2FGetting_Started_With_Fandom%3A_Signing_Up_%2526_Personalization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&uselang=en&metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section" data-testid="log-in-edit-section" aria-label="Sign in to edit"><!-- -1 children --></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
<p>If you have not already signed up, this is how you do it:
</p>
<div id="gallery-0" hash="709a03a8df3d7eb5d8205f580fbea71a" data-seq-no="0" class="wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium"><div class="wikia-gallery-caption"></div><div class="wikia-gallery-item" style="width:302px; "><div class="thumb" style="height:192px;"><!-- -1 children --></div><div class="lightbox-caption" style="width:300px;">Mobile: Tap on the avatar icon in the top right of your screen and tap "Register". This takes you to the registration flow.</div></div><div class="wikia-gallery-item" style="width:302px; "><div class="thumb" style="height:192px;"><!-- -1 children --></div><div class="lightbox-caption" style="width:300px;">Desktop: On the top right of each Fandom page, you can see an option that says "Register". This takes you to the registration flow.</div></div></div>
<p>Direct link: <a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="external free" href="https://auth.fandom.com/register">https://auth.fandom.com/register</a>
</p><p>Next, choose an option to register - you can connect using social media (Facebook, Google, Twitch, Apple) or register with an email and password. After signing up with an email, you will be asked to verify your email, so make sure to check your inbox!
</p>
<h2><span id="How_do_I_set_up_my_viewing_experience.3F"></span><span class="mw-headline" id="How_do_I_set_up_my_viewing_experience?">How do I set up my viewing experience?</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a title="Sign in to edit" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor" data-tracking-label="log-in-edit-section" data-action="edit-section" href="https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fcommunity.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUser_blog%3AMarphimon%2FGetting_Started_With_Fandom%3A_Signing_Up_%2526_Personalization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&uselang=en&metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section" data-testid="log-in-edit-section" aria-label="Sign in to edit"><!-- -1 children --></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
<p>Congratulations on signing up and joining the Fandom community! To make sure you have the best possible viewing experience tailored to your needs, let's visit your user account settings.  On Fandom, these are called "Preferences", which is what you will see in the screenshots. Keep in mind for later - settings = preferences, because it's about your <i>preferred</i> settings!
</p><p>If you are looking to adjust your text size on mobile, you will need to tap "mobile options". This will bring you to the following screen.
</p><p><b>Special Mobile Specific Settings</b>
</p>
<figure class="thumb mw-halign-center show-info-icon" typeof="mw:File/Thumb" style="width: 400px"> 	<a href="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/central/images/4/46/Simple-preferences-mobilesettings-mobile.png/revision/latest?cb=20230718082048" class="mw-file-description image" style="display: inline-block; position: relative;"><img alt="Customizing your mobile specific settings" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="400" height="467" class="thumbimage lazyload" data-image-name="Simple-preferences-mobilesettings-mobile.png" data-image-key="Simple-preferences-mobilesettings-mobile.png" data-relevant="1" data-src="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/central/images/4/46/Simple-preferences-mobilesettings-mobile.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20230718082048"><div style="position: absolute; bottom: 0px; right: 0px; width: 100%; height: 100%;"><!-- -1 children --></div></a> 	 	<figcaption class="thumbcaption"> 		 			 		 		 		 			<p class="caption">Customizing your mobile specific settings</p> 		 	</figcaption> </figure>
<div style="clear: both;"></div>
<h3><span id="Accessing_your_account_settings_.2F_user_preferences"></span><span class="mw-headline" id="Accessing_your_account_settings_/_user_preferences">Accessing your account settings / user preferences</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a title="Sign in to edit" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor" data-tracking-label="log-in-edit-section" data-action="edit-section" href="https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fcommunity.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUser_blog%3AMarphimon%2FGetting_Started_With_Fandom%3A_Signing_Up_%2526_Personalization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&uselang=en&metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section" data-testid="log-in-edit-section" aria-label="Sign in to edit"><!-- -1 children --></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h3>
<div id="gallery-1" hash="3b92a773c88f5bc5361b01849b1a05e1" data-seq-no="1" class="wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium"><div class="wikia-gallery-caption"></div><div class="wikia-gallery-item" style="width:302px; "><div class="thumb" style="height:227px;"><!-- -1 children --></div><div class="lightbox-caption" style="width:300px;">How to locate your user settings on mobile</div></div><div class="wikia-gallery-item" style="width:302px; "><div class="thumb" style="height:227px;"><!-- -1 children --></div><div class="lightbox-caption" style="width:300px;">How to locate your user settings on desktop</div></div></div>
<p>Now that we have accessed the settings - your "user preferences" - we'll dive into the most frequently asked questions.
</p><p><b>I prefer a light/dark theme, how can I update my settings/preferences?</b>
</p>
<dl><dd>When accessing your settings, you see 6 options near the top of your screen/the white page. By default, you see "User profile" highlighted. Next to it, there is a tab called "Appearance". Click that one.</dd></dl>
<div id="gallery-2" hash="9a8f063df88e31f54c3d65f88b3e51a9" data-seq-no="2" class="wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium"><div class="wikia-gallery-caption"></div><div class="wikia-gallery-item" style="width:302px; "><div class="thumb" style="height:279px;"><!-- -1 children --></div><div class="lightbox-caption" style="width:300px;">Location of "Appearance" tab. On smaller displays, you might have to scroll to the right to find it.</div></div><div class="wikia-gallery-item" style="width:302px; "><div class="thumb" style="height:279px;"><!-- -1 children --></div><div class="lightbox-caption" style="width:300px;">Choose the one you prefer - light or dark theme, or whichever the wiki you are visiting chose as a default!</div></div></div>
<dl><dd>You can also change this setting on the fly on each page if you want to check out how a wiki looks in the other theme!</dd></dl>
